A thread without time waits on the run queue all the same.
It takes turns before the threads on spare time, and one held to its units is not;
a ready thread waits on the queue its account and binding say.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work test qemu-replay
Report: a place waits on another queue than its account says
Witness: fuzz actor-handoff

